  Nemesis) already get removed from bonesfiles on loading. Extend this
  to inspecting statues loaded with bonesfiles and removing their
  oattached details if they are Significant. This reduces them to the
  same status as a wished-for statue of a unique monster, which
  already gets checked for and won't animate.

